{
  "version": "1.1",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Newspaper 报纸多栏流版式样例",
    "description": "导语通栏、正文多栏流动排版与全屏数据图"
  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "lay-news",
      "kind": "layout",
      "type": "layout",
      "props": {
        "pattern": "newspaper",
        "placements": [
          { "nodeId": "hd-lead", "role": "lead", "orderOnMobile": 1 },
          { "nodeId": "md-body", "role": "body", "orderOnMobile": 2 },
          { "nodeId": "pan-aside", "role": "aside", "orderOnMobile": 3 },
          { "nodeId": "ch-full", "role": "full", "orderOnMobile": 4 }
        ]
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "hd-lead",
          "kind": "block",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 1,
            "content": "微明知识中枢：赋能全链路工程协作"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "md-body",
          "kind": "block",
          "type": "markdown",
          "props": {
            "content": "在现代复杂软件工程中，AI 与开发者的协作已经从单纯的代码补全走向系统级的长效认知。微明通过将六大核心能力解耦，在保证分层纯粹的同时，为多 Agent 编排提供了稳固的上下文基石。\n\n文档作为认知传递的主要载体，需要同时兼顾长文阅读的呼吸感与严谨的数据可视化。报纸多栏排版为长篇论述提供了绝佳的视觉节奏。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pan-aside",
          "kind": "container",
          "type": "panel",
          "props": {
            "variant": "aside",
            "title": "要点快讯"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "co-aside-1",
              "kind": "block",
              "type": "callout",
              "props": {
                "level": "info",
                "title": "编者按",
                "content": "本文档由微明出版级美学引擎自动排版渲染。"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ch-full",
          "kind": "block",
          "type": "chart",
          "props": {
            "chartType": "line",
            "title": "全网调用与索引趋势",
            "categories": ["一月", "二月", "三月", "四月"],
            "series": [
              {
                "name": "活跃会话",
                "data": [150, 230, 320, 480]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
